{"title": "Food Supply Table 12", "pageid": 13905, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_12", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Food Supply Table 12</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Food_12</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_12+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_12+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing a large <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>.\n</p><p>Its name seems to be based on the fact that the average Supplies value of this table is exactly 12.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p>Although this drop table is described below for completeness's sake, it is better to simply insert a pumpkin into any drop table that references this one.\n</p><p><i>The average roll on <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Food Supply Table 12</a> is worth 12 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/e9/FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/FOOD_Pumpkin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212207\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 514/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4144/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 716/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 646405/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.151      1 -total\n 49.61%   10.989      1 Template:DropTableRow\n 43.69%    9.678      1 Template:LgRarityItem\n 34.35%    7.609      1 Template:Item_icon\n 29.73%    6.586      1 Template:ItemIcon_Insert\n 14.02%    3.106      1 Template:Norbyte\n 10.40%    2.304      2 Template:Ifempty\n  8.80%    1.950      2 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n  5.94%    1.316      8 Template:Trim\n  4.08%    0.903      2 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13905-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212207 and revision id 396606. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}